text Yes, it's snow.
text Even now, it continues to fall, coating me in its paleness.
text Ah...
text What could I be doing here...?
text Better yet, how long have I been here...?
text ......
text My hand is buried in snow.
text It's holding on to something.
text I pull it out.
text It's a pure-white hand.
text A girl's hand.
text Oh, yeah, that's right...
text I wasn't alone.
text I wipe away the snow on her face.
text Her profile, sleeping peacefully, appears before me.
text This girl and I... had always been together.
text Here in this world.
text This empty, sorrowful world.
text And then, the two of us...
text Have walked all the way here.
text In order to escape this world.
text Ever since that day.
text We've been walking... We always have been.
text She's forced her crippled body forward...
text And walked on and on...
text We passed the point of no return...
text The snow may have buried our feet...
text And it may have buried my body...
text But the two of us helped each other out...
text We set our sights ahead of us...
text And walked.
text And now...
text We've run out of strength.
text She's unable to take another step.
text My own body is in shambles too, having supported hers all this time.
text Not to mention, my body is half-buried.
text I can't carry her with this small frame of mine.
text I put my hand to her cheek.
text Does she seem warm only because that's how I remember her?
text She should feel the same as my hand... Cold to the core.
text If this is how it was going to turn out, I never should have taken her...
text All I've done is cause her pain...
text Is there nowhere we can go now...?
text Will we sleep forever here?
text In this never-ending world?
text ..."Hey..."
text I hear a voice from inside the blizzard.
text It's hers.
text But her eyes are still closed.
text ..."Are you... there...?"
text Of course.
text I'll always be by your side.
text ..."Thank you..."
text What...?
text ..."I was finally able to hear your voice."
text Why?
text ..."Because I won't be human for much longer."
text ..."That's why I'm able to hear the voice in your heart."
text What does that mean?
text ..."I've come to understand a lot of things."
text ..."A lot of things I never knew."
text I see...
text But now we can talk.
text We can talk so much.
text ..."Yeah."
text ..."But there's no time left."
text ..."I want you to hear what I have to say."
text ..."Will you listen?"
text Of course...
text ..."I... was once in a different, far-off world too..."
text ..."The same world you were in, actually."
text Really?
text ..."Yeah..."
text So you weren't supposed to be in this world after all...
text So then let's just go home.
text ..."I'm sorry, I..."
text ..."I have to stay here..."
text Why?
text ..."You see..."
text ..."I am this world."
text ......
text ..."I'm going to become unable to move here in just a bit..."
text ..."When that happens, I'll lose my human form..."
text ..."And after that, I'll become the will of this world..."
text ......
text ..."So that's why I have to stay here..."
text Who... said it had to be like that...?
text ..."I did..."
text ..."This is something that I decided...."
text ..."I was the first life to be born from this place..."
text ..."So rather than die, I chose to become the will of this world..."
text I don't understand... What do you mean?
text But, we made a promise... You said you'd leave this world together with me.
text ..."Yes... Because I didn't know anything back then..."
text ..."I'm sorry..."
text ..."I understand a lot of things now..."
text ..."I've already started to become connected to this place..."
text ..."So while my body may not move... I'm at least able to speak with you like this..."
text Doesn't it hurt?
text ..."No, I'm okay now..."
text ..."So please, listen..."
text Okay...
text ..."If I leave this place, this world will disappear..."
text ..."And if I do that, I know sadness will come to all of the little lights..."
text Lights?
text ..."You were once one of those lights too, you know..."
text I was?
text ..."Yes. They're the thoughts and feelings of the people who live in the other world..."
text The other world?
text ..."The world both further and closer to us than any other."
text ..."We were always nearby. We were always there."
text ..."In the same place."
text ..."We just saw things in a different way."
text ..."This isn't the world of humans..."
text But you're a human...
text ..."No... I've started to change into something that isn't human..."
text ..."Ever since I first came here."
text What do you mean by that...?
text ..."This world."
text World?
text Then what exactly is this world?
text ..."I don't know the answer to that..."
text ..."But I think you might be able to figure it out..."
text ..."Because you exist in both worlds..."
text ..."The lights and I live in different worlds, so we shouldn't have been able to notice each other's existence..."
text ..."But you were the one light who noticed me..."
text ..."You were always watching me, never leaving me..."
text ..."So I built your body... And you inhabited it..."
text ..."You traveled from one world to the other, and because of that, we were able to meet..."
text ..."I was able to spend... my final moments... with a human heart, without having to feel alone."
text ......
text ..."It's thanks to you..."
text ..."And that's more than enough for me..."
text ..."I couldn't ask to be any happier..."
text ...
text ..."So next, it's time for you to save someone else..."
text ......
text ..."Okay?"
text ..."You're going to cut yourself off from this place..."
text ..."That is how you're going to leave this world..."
text ..."Then... you're going to wake up on an important day in the other world... right before a lot of things are to take place."
text ..."This is where that day takes place..."
text ..."It's a place at the end of a long journey you've been on..."
text ..."But you can't bring any of your memories from here with you..."
text ..."So it may all end in the same way..."
text ..."But... if there's ever someone you want to save..."
text ..."Search for the light in the other world..."
text Light...?
text ..."Yes, light."
text ..."Just as the thoughts of many people in the other world appear as lights in this one..."
text ..."My thoughts should appear as light in the other world too..."
text ..."My thoughts are the heart of the world..."
text ..."A heart that wishes for all of the little lights to be happy..."
text ..."If someone precious to you ever becomes unhappy..."
text ..."I want you to use that to save them..."
text No...
text I want to save you...
text ..."It's okay. I..."
text How do you expect me to leave you behind...?
text This world... is so lonely...
text So cold... And freezing...
text If I leave here, you'll be alone again...
text In this never-ending world...
text Always alone...
text ..."That is what I've wished for..."
text ..."I'll watch over you..."
text ..."From now on..."
text ..."To forever..."
text No...
text ......
text I don't want that...
text ......
text I hear a sound amidst the wind.
text It reminds me of something from that far-off world.
text A memory from a distant spring day.
text There was a song we once sang in the sun's warm and peaceful beams.
text For a short period of time...
text There was a song we sang as a small family.
sound 5.aac -1
text I notice that the girl's mouth is moving ever so slightly.
text She's singing the song.
text ..."Dango...! Dango...!"
text A song we sang over and over for a little life.
text I begin to sing too.
text We sing together.
text We keep singing.
text She smiles.
text I smile too.
text If only...
text If only we could be like this forever.
sound ~
text A blast of wind knocks us apart.
